VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN masks ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;
DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 2000 2000 ) ;
TRACKS Y 50 DO 20 STEP 100 LAYER M1 ;
TRACKS X 50 DO 20 STEP 100 LAYER M2 ;
TRACKS Y 100 DO 10 STEP 200 LAYER M3 ;
PINS 1 ;
- p + NET a + DIRECTION INPUT + USE SIGNAL
  + LAYER M2 MASK 2 ( -25 0 ) ( 25 100 )
  + PLACED ( 950 1900 ) N ;
END PINS
SPECIALNETS 1 ;
- VDD ( * VDD ) + USE POWER
  + ROUTED M1 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 1950 ) MASK 2 ( 2000 1950 ) ;
END SPECIALNETS
NETS 2 ;
- a ( PIN p )
  + ROUTED M1 ( 50 50 ) MASK 1 ( 950 50 )
  NEW M1 ( 50 150 ) MASK 2 ( 950 150 ) MASK 021 V12
  NEW M2 ( 950 150 ) MASK 1 ( 950 1050 ) ;
- b
  + ROUTED M1 ( 50 250 ) ( 950 250 ) ;
END NETS
END DESIGN
